{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "66556",
  "name": "Bliston Suwan Park View",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the surrounding area",
      "text": "A stay at Bliston Suwan Park View places you in the heart of Bangkok, within a 15-minute walk of Erawan Shrine and CentralWorld Shopping Complex.  This family-friendly hotel is 0.6 mi (1 km) from Nana Square and 0.7 mi (1.2 km) from Bumrungrad Hospital."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Details of room types available",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 152 air-conditioned rooms featuring kitchenettes with full-sized refrigerators/freezers and stovetops. Rooms have private balconies. Flat-screen televisions with satellite programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the hotel property",
      "text": "Don\u0027t miss out on the many recreational opportunities, including an outdoor pool, a sauna, and a fitness center. Additional features at this hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and babysitting (surcharge)."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Activities available near the hotel",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003ECentral Embassy - 0.4 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Chidlom Department Store - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Erawan Shrine - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Nana Square - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Embassy of the United States - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E CentralWorld Shopping Complex - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bumrungrad Hospital - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lumphini Park - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Paragon Mall - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pratunam Market - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Platinum Fashion Mall - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Center - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn University - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Square - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn Hospital - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 28.3 km / 17.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 31.7 km / 19.7 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Bliston Suwan Park View is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Hotel policies and disclaimer",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoise-free guestrooms cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher and a security system\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E   \u003Cli\u003EOne child 11 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EParking height restrictions apply. \u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Meals and restaurants at the hotel",
      "text": "Enjoy Thai cuisine at Pine Place Restaurant, one of the hotel\u0027s 2 restaurants, or stay in and take advantage of the room service (during limited hours). Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 6 AM to 10 AM for a fee."
    },
    {
